<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling falls vs dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling falls vs dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling eased against the dollar and the pound in line with market expectations, the central Bank of Tanzania said on Monday.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling exchanged at a mean rate of 625.0464 compared to Friday's 624.7098. Compared to the pound, the shilling traded at 1056.6113 against Friday's 1054.8257.</p>
